  "agentGuide": "Base path /calendar/v3. Calendars: GET /users/me/calendarList (items[].id, summary; \"primary\" is the main one). Events: GET /calendars/primary/events?timeMin=<ISO>&timeMax=<ISO>&singleEvents=true&orderBy=startTime&maxResults=50 (items[].summary, start.dateTime or start.date for all-day, end, location, attendees, hangoutLink). Create: POST /calendars/primary/events {\"summary\": \"...\", \"start\": {\"dateTime\": \"2026-10-02T10:00:00+02:00\"}, \"end\": {\"dateTime\": \"...\"}, \"attendees\": [{\"email\": \"...\"}], \"description\": \"...\"} (all-day: {\"date\": \"2026-10-02\"}; invitations are sent with ?sendUpdates=all). Change: PATCH /calendars/primary/events/<id>; remove: DELETE .... Free slots: POST /freeBusy {\"timeMin\": \"...\", \"timeMax\": \"...\", \"items\": [{\"id\": \"primary\"}]}. Quick add from a sentence: POST /calendars/primary/events/quickAdd?text=Lunch with Anna tomorrow 12:30. Times are RFC 3339 with an offset; give the user's time zone.",
